{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":5,"count":31,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L03-3-05\",\"点心\",\"點心\",\"点心\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"甜的點心叫甜點。","pinyin":"Tián de diǎnxīn jiào tiándiǎn.","english":"Sweet snacks are called dessert.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-3-05","sourceFront":"點心","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-08\",\"海边\",\"海邊\",\"海边\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天天氣不錯，我們去海邊曬太陽吧。","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì búcuò, wǒmen qù hǎibiān shài tàiyáng ba.","english":"The weather is nice today. Let’s go to the beach to get some sun!","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-08","sourceFront":"海邊","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"今天天氣不錯，海邊的風景也很漂亮，我想去游泳，妳們想去嗎？","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì búcuò, hǎibiān de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliàng, wǒ xiǎng qù yóuyǒng, nǐmen xiǎng qù ma?","english":"The weather is pretty good today, so is the view at the beach. I want to go swimming. Do you want to go?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-2-02\",\"中間\",\"中間\",\"中间\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我媽媽的花店在百貨公司和超級市場中間。","pinyin":"Wǒ māma de huādiàn zài bǎihuò gōngsī hé chāojí shìchǎng zhōngjiān.","english":"My mother's flower shop is between the department store and the supermarket.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-02","sourceFront":"中間","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"中(central) + 間(space) → the central space, meaning middle, between, among."},{"key":"[\"B1L09-2-04\",\"能\",\"能\",\"能\",\"Vaux\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們班只能禮拜一跟禮拜二下午用。","pinyin":"Wǒmen bān zhǐ néng lǐbài yī gēn lǐbài èr xiàwǔ yòng.","english":"Our class can only use it in the afternoon on Mondays and Tuesdays.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"可是這些時間我都有語言交換，不能去。","pinyin":"Kěshì zhèxiē shíjiān wǒ dōu yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, bù néng qù.","english":"But I will be doing language exchange during that time. I can’t make it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"太好了！在那裡看書很舒服。我們每天都能用那間教室嗎？","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le! Zài nàlǐ kànshū hěn shūfu. Wǒmen měi tiān dōu néng yòng nà jiān jiàoshì ma?","english":"That’s awesome! Studying there is very comfortable. Can we use it every day?","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"老師，國安今天要請假。他發燒了，不能來上課。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī, Guó'ān jīntiān yào qǐngjià. Tā fāshāo le, bù néng lái shàngkè.","english":"Teacher, Guoan has to take a leave today. He has a fever and he can’t come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他打電話跟我說，他不能來上課，請我幫他請假。","pinyin":"Tā dǎ diànhuà gēn wǒ shuō, tā bù néng lái shàngkè, qǐng wǒ bāng tā qǐngjià.","english":"He gave me a call and told me that he couldn’t make it to class and asked me to ask for a leave for him.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們都希望他明天能回學校上課。","pinyin":"Wǒmen dōu xīwàng tā míngtiān néng huí xuéxiào shàngkè.","english":"We all hope he can come back to school tomorrow.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 䏍(secret flesh) grips a 匕(spoon) → showing what a strong body 能(can) do."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-3-05\",\"兒子\",\"兒子\",\"儿子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"李先生有三個孩子，一個兒子，兩個女兒。","pinyin":"Lǐ xiānshēng yǒu sān ge háizi, yí ge érzi, liǎng ge nǚ'ér.","english":"Mr. Li has three children: one son and two daughters.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-06","sourceFront":"女兒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"兒子跟女兒都在睡覺，你不要說得太大聲。","pinyin":"Érzi gēn nǚ'ér dōu zài shuìjiào, nǐ búyào shuō de tài dàshēng.","english":"Both my son and daughter are sleeping; don't speak too loudly.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-2-08","sourceFront":"大聲","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王伯伯最近很得意，到處告訴鄰居他兒子考上了全國最有名的大學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-27","sourceFront":"得意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我是家中第二個兒子，大哥比我大三歲，平常相處得還不錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-03","sourceFront":"大哥","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王伯伯為兒子辦喜事，擺了五十桌喜酒，熱鬧極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-35","sourceFront":"桌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"兒(son) + 子(noun suffix) → your boy: 兒子(son)."},{"key":"[\"B1L13-1-18\",\"早\",\"早\",\"早\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我平常早上七點起床，八點吃早飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ píngcháng zǎoshang qī diǎn qǐchuáng, bā diǎn chī zǎofàn.","english":"I usually get up at seven and have breakfast at eight in the morning.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-11","sourceFront":"平常","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我每天早上七點去學校運動。","pinyin":"Wǒ měi tiān zǎoshang qī diǎn qù xuéxiào yùndòng.","english":"I go to school to exercise at 7:00 every morning.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-13","sourceFront":"運動","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我爸爸每天早上都喝一杯咖啡。","pinyin":"Wǒ bàba měi tiān zǎoshang dōu hē yì bēi kāfēi.","english":"My father drinks a cup of coffee every morning.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-10","sourceFront":"天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A：你今天早上有課嗎？ B：我今天早上沒有課。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ jīntiān zǎoshang yǒu kè ma? B: Wǒ jīntiān zǎoshang méi yǒu kè.","english":"A: Do you have class this morning? B: I don’t have class this morning.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-19","sourceFront":"課","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我早上沒有課，九點去圖書館。","pinyin":"Wǒ zǎoshang méi yǒu kè, jiǔ diǎn qù túshūguǎn.","english":"I don’t have class in the morning. I am going to the library at 9:00.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-01","sourceFront":"幾","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 日(sun) climbs past 十(ten) on the clock → 早(early)."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-15\",\"舞会\",\"舞會\",\"舞会\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個禮拜六我們學校有舞會，你要參加嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-15","sourceFront":"舞會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每年大學迎新時，學校總是會辦舞會歡迎大家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-11","sourceFront":"迎新","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"化裝舞會上他打扮成一具機器人，連說話走路都模仿機器人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-11","sourceFront":"具","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-1-34\",\"喔\",\"喔\",\"喔\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你明天有考試，要早一點起床喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-34","sourceFront":"喔","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這幾朵玫瑰花好漂亮喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-30","sourceFront":"玫瑰","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"來來來，快來買！我們3C產品的價格最優惠，品質也很好，快把握機會喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-13","sourceFront":"優惠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我昨天親眼看到小史跟人吵架，才知道他罵人的樣子好可怕喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-18","sourceFront":"親眼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"室友A:嘿，吃完飯後不能把碗筷擺在桌子讓別人洗喔。室友B:不好意思，我這就去洗。室友A:嘿，你還真聽話(obedient)啊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-36","sourceFront":"嘿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:江先生對父母很孝順，個性又溫柔，將來一定是好先生。B:這還用說嗎？要是妳對他有意思，就得早點兒行動喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-60","sourceFront":"這還用說嗎？","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-2-18\",\"平常\",\"平常\",\"平常\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我平常喜歡喝茶，有（的）時候喝一點兒咖啡。","pinyin":"Wǒ píngcháng xǐhuān hē chá, yǒu (de) shíhou hē yìdiǎnr kāfēi.","english":"I usually like drinking tea. Sometimes I drink a little coffee.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-12","sourceFront":"有（的）時候","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我平常早上七點起床，八點吃早飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ píngcháng zǎoshang qī diǎn qǐchuáng, bā diǎn chī zǎofàn.","english":"I usually get up at seven and have breakfast at eight in the morning.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-11","sourceFront":"平常","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"平常不生病的人也要注意。","pinyin":"Píngcháng bù shēngbìng de rén yě yào zhùyì.","english":"People who don’t get sick often should pay attention to their health as well.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我平常坐紅線去學校上課，週末也坐捷運去運動、看電影。","pinyin":"Wǒ píngcháng zuò hóng xiàn qù xuéxiào shàngkè, zhōumò yě zuò jiéyùn qù yùndòng, kàn diànyǐng.","english":"I usually go to school by the red one. On weekends I take it to exercise or see a movie as well.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"平(flat) + 常(common) → flat and common days: 平常(generally; usually)."},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-20\",\"感覺\",\"感覺\",\"感觉\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"昨天晚上我發燒，燒到三十九度，那種感覺非常不舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-20","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"愛心服務社社員去安養院陪老人過年，讓老人們感覺相當溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-30","sourceFront":"相當","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"林明生躺在草地上看星星，他感覺真輕鬆。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-19","sourceFront":"輕鬆","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"第一次約會的時候，林先生感覺(到)自己很緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-18","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這棟公寓除了環境不錯，家具還很新，感覺住起來會很舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-18","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小時候爺爺常陪我做功課、教我打球和釣魚，現在回想起那段時間，感覺真幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-26","sourceFront":"回想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部電影是用真實故事拍成的，讓觀眾感覺很真實，也很感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-30","sourceFront":"真實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部愛情電影是根據真實故事拍出來的，看過的人都很有感覺。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-01","sourceFront":"根據","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"教授的房間堆滿了各種書籍，本來就不大的房間感覺更擠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-25","sourceFront":"堆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"彩色照片看起來很真實，不過黑白照片給人的感覺也很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-29","sourceFront":"彩色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的布告上貼著超市打折活動的廣告，感覺真的很怪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-08","sourceFront":"布告","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"接觸陌生的事情及環境時，往往令人有點兒不安，這樣的感覺是很自然的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-25","sourceFront":"不安","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天運動過後，喝杯冰冰涼涼的冷飲，感覺很痛快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-24","sourceFront":"冷飲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在戶外的夜景中攝影，以月光當作背景可增加神秘的感覺。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-24","sourceFront":"月光","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L02-2-26\",\"满\",\"滿\",\"满\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"錢老闆滿腦子都是工作，每天只想著怎麼讓公司成長得快一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-26","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小簡向很多公司自我推薦，經過了幾個月，最後找到了滿意的工作","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-14","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在你的國家，成年的孩子常跟父母住在一起，還是滿十八歲就搬出去了？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-11","sourceFront":"成年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我有一個幸福美滿的家庭，父母都很愛我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-24","sourceFront":"家庭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老闆很滿意小陳的工作表現， 明年要請他當經理呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourc