闆就免費招待一盤炒青菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-41","sourceFront":"招待","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-04","sourceFront":"行程","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-04","sourceFront":"歌仔戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳的菜不僅平價，還很營養，常常中午十二點前舉客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-11","sourceFront":"平價","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆收到一封寫滿越南文的信，辦公室沒人看得懂，非找人翻譯不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-18","sourceFront":"非","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃先生上班常遲到，也不認真工作，這樣的態度讓老闆很不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-21","sourceFront":"不滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些家長對現在的升學制度不滿，認為學校不應該逼孩子寫那麼多測驗題目。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-28","sourceFront":"制度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張經理今天的工作行程安排得很滿，連吃飯、休息的時間都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-14","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過教授的介紹，我一畢業就順利地找到了滿意的工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-02","sourceFront":"透過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我打工的餐廳一到週末就客滿，忙不過來的時候，連老闆的叔叔都得來幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-33","sourceFront":"忙不過來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母送我的結婚禮物很珍貴，包含了他們對我滿滿的祝福。","pinyin"