,{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-30\",\"拌\",\"拌\",\"拌\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小孩子剛學習用筷子吃麵條時，常需要媽媽先替他把麵拌一拌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-30","sourceFront":"拌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"她把蛋白拌進麵粉裡，加點兒花生烤一烤，又香又好吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-34","sourceFront":"蛋白","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-2-10\",\"失败\",\"失敗\",\"失败\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"別怕失敗，因為失敗的經驗比成功更珍貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-10","sourceFront":"失敗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"己\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"One curved line hooks inward to touch itself → 己(self)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"旅館\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"旅(journey) + 館(public building) → a building for travelers: 旅館(inn; hotel)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"沙發\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"沙(shā) + 發(fā) mimic the sound of 'sofa' → this word means sofa."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"深\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"氵(water) floods the 罙(cave with fire) until it is 深(deep)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"英\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 艹(grass) sprout stands at the 央(center) of the globe → the 英(English) isle."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"車禍\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 車(car) and 禍(misfortune): 車禍 means car accident."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"顏色\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"顏色 means color: 顏(face) + 色(color) → the color on your face is a color."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"驚訝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 驚(frighten) and 訝(amazed): 驚訝 means surprised."}]}
